# Title: MMC20 Lateral Movement
# ID: f1f3bf22-deb2-418d-8cce-e1a45e46a5bd
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: @2xxeformyshirt (Security Risk Advisors) - rule; Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea)
# Date: 2020-03-04
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1021.003
# Description: Detects MMC20.Application Lateral Movement; specifically looks for the spawning of the parent MMC.exe with a command line of "-Embedding" as a child of svchost.exe
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (parent_process_path="*\\svchost.exe" AND process_path="*\\mmc.exe" AND process_exec="*-Embedding*")
